* text=auto

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Linguist overrides — keep the public open-core mirror's GitHub language
# stats accurate. public/ is the web docroot (compiled Vite output + published
# third-party package assets) and resources/themes/*/assets/ are bundled theme
# assets — none of it is hand-authored project source. Without these the
# mirror's language bar reads as a JavaScript/CSS project instead of the PHP
# application it actually is. See github.com/github-linguist/linguist.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/** linguist-vendored
public/build/** linguist-generated
resources/themes/*/assets/** linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-documentation
